==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Clefairy|39}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Generations|Clefairy|50}} from the {{TCG|Generations}} expansion.
*'''Slap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Sabrina's Mr. Mime|94}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Clefairy}}.

